# Maven build output - regenerated by `mvn compile`/`mvn test`, and was
# causing spurious merge conflicts between branches since it's compiled
# independently (and differently) on every machine.
target/

# Test run output - logs, failure screenshots, and HTML reports are all
# regenerated fresh by every run and differ per machine/run, so tracking
# them causes the exact same kind of repo bloat and spurious diffs
# target/ used to. Keep the folders themselves (via .gitkeep) so a fresh
# clone has somewhere for the app to write into before the first run -
# each platform's own ScreenshotUtil/log4j2 config creates the rest.
#
# mobile-automation.log is temporarily tracked (not ignored) so real-device
# startup-timing logs reach this branch for the mobile startup-delay debug -
# re-add it to the ignore list once that's resolved.
logs/web-automation.log
logs/*.log.gz
screenshots/mobile/*
screenshots/web/*
!screenshots/mobile/.gitkeep
!screenshots/web/.gitkeep
reports/
test-output/
